SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CET: Quindici Minuti di Riflessione 2027: Short Perf
 ormance Competition (1st edition\, Sassari)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 30 Nov 2026 at 23:59 CET.\n\nFirst edition of an interna
 tional competition for short live performances of around fifteen minutes i
 n dance and physical theatre\, run by Music & Movie ETS within the InterAg
 endo project. Works must carry an ethical\, civic or social theme. Six com
 panies are selected to perform in Sassari on 6-8 May 2027 in front of a Na
 tional Jury\, a Schools and Community Jury and a Territorial Jury.\n\nOrga
 nisation: Music & Movie ETS (InterAgendo project)\nLocation: Sala Teatrale
  Palazzo di Città\, Sassari\, Sardinia\, Italy (6-8 May 2027). Open to It
 alian and international companies and artists.\nAward: Guaranteed gross al
 l-inclusive fee for each of six selected companies: EUR 500 (solo)\, EUR 7
 00 (duo)\, EUR 900 (three or more performers)\, plus three nights' accommo
 dation. Prizes: Best Work Award EUR 1\,000 gross (National Jury) and Refle
 ctions Award EUR 400 gross for the work with the strongest ethical and civ
 ic impact (Schools and Community Jury and Territorial Jury). Free to apply
 \; selected companies pay a EUR 50 deposit\, fully refunded after the fest
 ival.\nDuration: Festival 6-8 May 2027\n\nMore: https://musicandmovie.art/
 quindici-minuti-di-riflessione-concorso-internazionale-di-spettacoli-brevi
 /?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://musicandmovie.art/quindici-minuti-di-riflessione-concorso-inter
 nazionale-di-spettacoli-brevi/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_m
 edium=referral
LOCATION:Sala Teatrale Palazzo di Città\, Sassari\, Sardinia\, Italy (6-8 
 May 2027). Open to Italian and international companies and artists.
END:VEVENT
